BOX Tower

A port to the BOX (a RISC OS application environment that runs on Linux) of
tower-together, https://github.com/phulin/tower-together, commit 073c0e4,
Copyright 2026 Patrick Hulin, under the MIT licence (tower/UPSTREAM-LICENSE.md,
unchanged).

tower/sim is upstream's simulation (apps/worker/src/sim) translated from
TypeScript to Rust; the BOX's additions to it are in tower/sim/src/box_ext
and each hook into the translated files is marked "BOX:".  The pictures in
tower/art derived from upstream's apps/client/public/rooms are listed in
tower/art/PROVENANCE.md and say so in their first lines.

This is a modified version of tower-together.  It is not made, endorsed or
supported by the makers or publishers of the 1994 game, and it does not use
that game's name.

The BOX's changes and additions are under the MIT licence: LICENSE.md.
